olor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-send\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-icon=\"inline-start\"><path d=\"M14.536 21.686a.5.5 0 0 0 .937-.024l6.5-19a.496.496 0 0 0-.635-.635l-19 6.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.024.937l7.93 3.18a2 2 0 0 1 1.112 1.11z\"></path><path d=\"m21.854 2.147-10.94 10.939\"></path></svg>Submit application</button></div></div></form></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-pad\"><div class=\"container-site\"><div class=\"max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center\"><p class=\"mb-4 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.22em] text-primary justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z\"></path><path d=\"M20 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 4h-4\"></path><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg>Our Culture</p><h2 class=\"text-balance text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl\">How we work when no one is watching.</h2><p class=\"mt-5 text-pretty text-base leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground sm:text-lg\">We are remote by design, built around trust, and committed to doing our best work without the theater.</p></div><div class=\"mt-12 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3\"><div data-slot=\"card\" data-size=\"default\" class=\"group/card flex flex-col gap-(--card-spacing) overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-card text-sm text-card-foreground ring-1 ring-foreground/10 [--card-spacing:--spacing(4)] has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 has-[&gt;img:first-child]:pt-0 data-[size=sm]:[--card-spacing:--spacing(3)] data-[size=sm]:has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 *:[img:first-child]:rounded-t-xl *:[img:last-child]:rounded-b-xl p-6\"><div data-slot=\"card-content\" class=\"p-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lightbulb size-6 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"></path><path d=\"M9 18h6\"></path><path d=\"M10 22h4\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"mt-5 text-lg font-semibold\">Async by Default</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">We write things down, make decisions visible, and respect deep focus time. Meetings are the exception, not the default.</p></div></div><div data-slot=\"card\" data-size=\"default\" class=\"group/card flex flex-col gap-(--card-spacing) overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-card text-sm text-card-foreground ring-1 ring-foreground/10 [--card-spacing:--spacing(4)] has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 has-[&gt;img:first-child]:pt-0 data-[size=sm]:[--card-spacing:--spacing(3)] data-[size=sm]:has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 *:[img:first-child]:rounded-t-xl *:[img:last-child]:rounded-b-xl p-6\"><div data-slot=\"card-content\" class=\"p-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin size-6 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><h3 class=\"mt-5 text-lg font-semibold\">Distributed &amp; Connected</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Team members span 12 time zones. We invest in connection through retreats, pairing, and deliberate communication practices.</p></div></div><div data-slot=\"card\" data-size=\"default\" class=\"group/card flex flex-col gap-(--card-spacing) overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-card text-sm text-card-foreground ring-1 ring-foreground/10 [--card-spacing:--spacing(4)] has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 has-[&gt;img:first-child]:pt-0 data-[size=sm]:[--card-spacing:--spacing(3)] data-[size=sm]:has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 *:[img:first-child]:rounded-t-xl *:[img:last-child]:rounded-b-xl p-6\"><div data-slot=\"card-content\" class=\"p-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart size-6 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 9.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 9.591-3.676.56.56 0 0 0 .818 0A5.49 5.49 0 0 1 22 9.5c0 2.29-1.5 4-3 5.5l-5.492 5.313a2 2 0 0 1-3 .019L5 15c-1.5-1.5-3-3.2-3-5.5\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"mt-5 text-lg font-semibold\">Sustainable Excellence</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">We ship great work without burnout. Quality comes from consistent pace, not heroic sprints. We are building for the long term.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-pad bg-foreground text-background\"><div class=\"container-site text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-balance text-3xl font-semibold sm:text-4xl\">Don&#x27;t see the right role?</h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-4 max-w-lg text-background/60\">We are always looking for exceptional engineers, designers, and thinkers. Send us your details and we will reach out when something fits.</p><a role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-slot=\"button\" class=\"group/button inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-transparent bg-clip-padding text-sm font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-all outline-none select-no